HAMA DVD player for sale!
The video player is 2.4 GHz and uses the Xcode software to play movies in standard formats: WMV, MP4 or MKV.
It supports video formats compliant with ISO/IEC 13818-2 MPEG2 and compliant to V4L & V4L2 standard as well as H.264 /H.265 and H.262 decoding of AVC-Intra video stream encoded by MPEG4-AV (Part 63):
MPG, VOB, QT, AVI, DVI…
Some interfaces are available:
* SD Card reader with video format conversion, NTSC/PAL/SECAM compatibility to connect to an external card reader;
* USB ports with standard memory type support;
* Video output via HDMI or composite video RCA connector, to a TV, for display in native mode or standard HDMI to analog audio connector to integrate into your sound-video system without HDMI source;
* HDMI connection up to 1080p60 standard
